# Reference 3D models: six .glb files at ~89 MB each, 535 MB in total. The
# jpegs beside them ARE committed — the tests and the reference-scale work in
# docs/ADR-002 use them — but the models are not: git keeps binaries in history
# forever, so every clone would pay half a gigabyte for assets that live on the
# design machine anyway.
sample/*.glb
